<title>FINLAND: FINNISH APRIL NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 14.5% YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH APRIL NEW PRIVATE CAR SALES UP 14.5% YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Registrations in Finland of new private cars increased 14.5 percent year-on-year in April to 10,728 units, the Information Centre of the Automobile Branch said in its monthly review on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p>				     change			  change</p>
<p>		  April '97     yr/yr pct  Jan-April '97  yr/yr pct</p>
<p> Private cars   10,728	 +14.5	   40,990	 +5.9</p>
<p> Vans		1,186	 +50.9	    4,014	+31.6</p>
<p> Lorries	     351	 +46.3	    1,378	+23.0</p>
<p> Buses		  54	 +58.8		190	 +8.0</p>
<p> Total	    12,319	 +18.1	   46,572	 +8.1</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
